From 6d64356bf8f26118447f1e0a1c3723d66ab84bdc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arvin Schnell <aschnell@suse.de>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:50:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Add command uuid to set UUID of partition on GPT.

This adds a new libparted function (ped_partition_set_uuid) and UI
(uuid) to set the UUID of a GPT partition.

NOTE: This changes interactive use since the uuid and units commands
both start with 'u'. The full command, or unique prefix, needs to be
used. During non-interactive use the 'u' shorthand is forced to mean
units in order to maintain backwards compatibility.

Signed-off-by: Brian C. Lane <bcl@redhat.com>
