 Note that after version 2.4, the following commands were removed:
@@ -1202,6 +1203,25 @@ Number  Start   End     Size    Type      File system  Flags
 
 @end deffn
 
+@node uuid
+@subsection uuid
+@cindex uuid, command description
+@cindex command description, uuid
+
+@deffn Command uuid @var{number} @var{uuid}
+
+Set the UUID of partition @var{number} to @var{uuid}. This will only work
+if the disk label supports it (currently GPT). The @var{uuid} is a
+36-character string in standard UUID format.
+
+Example:
+
+@example
+(parted) @kbd{uuid 1 12345678-abcd-1234-abcd-1234567890ab}
+@end example
+
+@end deffn
+
